  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OHCHR fr&#xe4;mjande av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Latinamerika 2023-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHR promoting human rights in Latin America 2023-2025 - OHCHR regional Latin America 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Promote the expansion of civic space and the protection of human rights defenders and 
journalists in the LAC region; 
2. Promote and protect the human rights of migrants in vulnerable situations;
3. Promote the right to a clean, healthy and sustainable environment.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser st&#xf6;d till FNs H&#xf6;gkommission&#xe4;r f&#xf6;r M&#xe4;nskliga R&#xe4;ttigheter (OHCHR) och deras regionala projekt f&#xf6;r fr&#xe4;mjande av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i Latinamerika under perioden 2023 till 2025, fokus ligger p&#xe5; tre omr&#xe5;den: 

1. Fr&#xe4;mjande av det demokratiska utrymmet och skydd av f&#xf6;rsvarare av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och journalister. 

2. Fr&#xe4;mjande och skydd av migranters m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i s&#xe5;rbara situationer. 

3. Fr&#xe4;mjande av r&#xe4;tten till en ren, h&#xe4;lsosam och h&#xe5;llbar milj&#xf6;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution supports the regional work of the UN High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR), promoting human rights in Latin America during the period 2023-2025, with specific focus on three areas: 

1. Promote the expansion of civic space and the protection of human rights defenders and
journalists in the LAC region;

2. Promote and protect the human rights of migrants in vulnerable situations;  

3. Promote the right to a clean, healthy and sustainable environment.</narrative>
  </description>
